                    </div>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm">
                        4 al 6 Jul • 2 Noches[span_18](start_span)[span_18](end_span)[span_19](start_span)[span_19](end_span)[span_20](start_span)[span_20](end_span)
