                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm mb-4">
                    <strong>Traslado al Pride:</strong> 5 a 10 min a pie del festival callejero y la cabecera del desfile[span_21](start_span)[span_21](end_span)[span_22](start_span)[span_22](end_span)[span_23](start_span)[span_23](end_span).
