                        </div>
                        <a href="https://www.booking.com/searchresults.es.html?ss=Cologne&checkin=2027-07-04&checkout=2027-07-06" target="_blank" class="block text-center bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition shadow">
