                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Departamentos (Airbnb)</span>
                                <span class="text-emerald-600 font-extrabold text-lg" id="colA">$260 – $360 USD</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">Alojamientos modernos y céntricos para el cierre.</p>
                        </div>
                        <a href="https://www.airbnb.com/cologne-germany/stays/2027-07-04/2027-07-06" target="_blank" class="block text-center bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition shadow">
                            Ver en Airbnb 🏠
