        </div>

        <!-- Resumen Financiero Dinámico -->
        <div class="mt-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900 to-indigo-900 text-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl text-center border border-purple-500/30 animate-fade-in">
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mb-2">💰 Resumen Total y Costo Individual</h2>
            <p class="text-purple-200 text-sm mb-4">Estimado combinado para las 13 noches de viaje en las 3 ciudades[span_24](start_span)[span_24](end_span)[span_25](start_span)[span_25](end_span)[span_26](start_span)[span_26](end_span)</p>
            
            <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-amber-300 mb-6" id="totalRange">
